OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy this morning with rain,
OL,6,Fheavy at times, spreading
OL,7,Fnortheastwards and clearing Orkney by
OL,8,Fthe afternoon and Shetland in the
OL,9,Fevening. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fwith gale risk diminishing through the
OL,11,Fday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain clears Shetland but
OL,14,Fmurky conditions remain this evening
OL,15,Fwith a risk of fog. Largely clear
OL,16,Fconditions for Orkney will spread to
OL,17,FShetland later. Winds easing somewhat
OL,18,Fthrough the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
