OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry with plenty of sunshine
OL,6,Ffor Shetland. Orkney will have a sunny
OL,7,Fmorning, with patchy cloud developing
OL,8,Fand a low risk of the odd shower in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FShowers
OL,12,For longer spells of rain on Friday
OL,13,Finterspersed with some bright spells.
OL,14,FThe weekend will be largely cloudy and
OL,15,Fwindy with patchy rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
